                "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM refund_adjustment", Integer.class));
        // 退款单仍停留在 IN_REVIEW/版本2，余额未占用
        JsonNode balance = getJson("/api/metro/refunds/balance/T4", 200);
        assertEquals(0L, balance.get("refundedCents").asLong());
